{"1932380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sucronomicon", "steam_appid": 1932380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SucroNomicon </i></strong>is a co-op multiplayer game where baking meets magic and chaos! Team up with up to three friends and enter kitchen-based arenas to craft enchanted confections using physics-driven tools. With voice chat, cursed legendary weapons, and hordes of baked monstrosities, every session is a deliciously unpredictable showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/129b73d1b1211ae010ec1cc837d9d30c.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The realm's only hope lies with the Bakorcists! </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the fairy tale kitchens with your team, or brave the heat solo to fend off the baked beasts in a sugary showdown while you bake the curse away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/8f6e7bc5ba8c057df3569a22f7ebf04d.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/082e27fc62f75fab295d674903489188.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/082e27fc62f75fab295d674903489188.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/082e27fc62f75fab295d674903489188.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bake your way to victory. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trained in the forbidden confectionery arts of the SucroNomicon by Hansel and Gretel themselves, you alone possess the skills to bake away the darkness. Master ancient recipes, wield enchanted ingredients, and cleanse these fantastical lands of evil, one spellbinding treat at a time. With realistic physics-based mechanics, every bake becomes a whimsical battle in this deliciously magical adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/a69b9361bd1093eb7f0868d155829b81.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/44bbe0d878c56d76867c69b1ac976d5c.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/44bbe0d878c56d76867c69b1ac976d5c.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/44bbe0d878c56d76867c69b1ac976d5c.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Team up to balance baking and brawling.</i> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board up windows with baguettes for a quick breather, set milk traps to slow your foes, and fling cookie cutters to dice up enemies. Armed with trusty kitchen utensils, slice, dice, and batter your way through hordes of fiends. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/4f3cd870aeecbf02d02d8f0d62e6e213.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9b23ac3ba244248b3a102f6842024742.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9b23ac3ba244248b3a102f6842024742.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9b23ac3ba244248b3a102f6842024742.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Witch of the Candy Woods has returned …</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and she’s seeking revenge! Once peaceful lands are now overrun by baked beasts, from gingerbread zombies to savage animal crackers, wreaking havoc wherever they go. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/ea0f5809dae78401a63af58b188b7024.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/0ba7b4c818a0a9606432520e03935494.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/0ba7b4c818a0a9606432520e03935494.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/0ba7b4c818a0a9606432520e03935494.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Each kitchen arena holds a secret. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve magical puzzles to uncover powerful Cursed Weapons hidden by the wicked Witch, or spend your hard-earned golden donuts to buy upgrades and enhance your baking tools for even more delicious destruction. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/4c0e549dfc7684e83ec68ae3f0d8fbc7.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Support the development!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By adding the game to your wishlist, you help bring it to life. Wishlist now and follow our journey on social media <strong>@redmeatgames</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/2ea851b7641e289147e7a25cb33a2a8f.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SucroNomicon </i></strong>is a co-op multiplayer game where baking meets magic and chaos! Team up with up to three friends and enter kitchen-based arenas to craft enchanted confections using physics-driven tools. With voice chat, cursed legendary weapons, and hordes of baked monstrosities, every session is a deliciously unpredictable showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/129b73d1b1211ae010ec1cc837d9d30c.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/29abd9fa241faeb0d652464a4f543fbc.mp4?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The realm's only hope lies with the Bakorcists! </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the fairy tale kitchens with your team, or brave the heat solo to fend off the baked beasts in a sugary showdown while you bake the curse away! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/8f6e7bc5ba8c057df3569a22f7ebf04d.webp?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=43 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/082e27fc62f75fab295d674903489188.poster.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/082e27fc62f75fab295d674903489188.webm?t=1782827833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\