deo/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Each kitchen arena holds a secret. </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve magical puzzles to uncover powerful Cursed Weapons hidden by the wicked Witch, or spend your hard-earned golden donuts to buy upgrades and enhance your baking tools for even more delicious destruction. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/4c0e549dfc7684e83ec68ae3f0d8fbc7.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Support the development!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By adding the game to your wishlist, you help bring it to life. Wishlist now and follow our journey on social media <strong>@redmeatgames</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/2ea851b7641e289147e7a25cb33a2a8f.avif?t=1782827833\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op PC/VR horror game for up to 4 players. Team up in haunted kitchen arenas to craft enchanted confections and break the witch’s curse while battling relentless baked beasts that storm the kitchen to stop you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/f7e3bd063ada5bd9aac84fea3a294d9add1bfdf2/header.jpg?t=1782827833", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/897bdb62745126f1d3b20616c0585f94ee590ca8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782827833", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store